n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"<b>How Could they fit all that in a bag?</b>\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"><b>Description</b></span></h2>\n<p><b>Bag of Scrambled Mystery</b> gives you random items from an Easter event when you open it. According to the description, the chance of getting a <a href=\"/wiki/Grabbit\" title=\"Grabbit\">Grabbit</a> is 1 in 777 (0.129%), and the chance of getting an <a href=\"/wiki/Easter_Moai\" title=\"Easter Moai\">Easter Moai</a> is 1 in 100 (1%).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\"><b>History</b></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Was added on the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Easter_event\" title=\"2025 Easter event\">2025 Easter event</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Easter_event\" title=\"2025 Easter event\">2025 Easter event</a>, it was sold at <a href=\"/wiki/Hop_%27N%27_Shop\" title=\"Hop &#39;N&#39; Shop\">Hop 'N' Shop</a>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902184047\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 57/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 62/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 27/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019532/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.969      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   52.969      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4947-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902184047 and revision id 21265. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Eggs","exists":true},{"title":"Finlay","exists":true},{"tit